+Fixed the empty recording issue in `src/linux.rs`.
+
+- Detects touchpads and absolute pointing devices, not only multi-button relative mice.
+- Converts absolute pointer input into relative movement events.
+- Resets touch position between gestures.
+- Drains queued mouse events before Escape cancellation, preventing empty recordings from quick stop sequences.
+- Added tests for absolute pointer conversion and touch release.
+
