[0m→ [0mRead docs/MIGRATION.md
The listener currently excludes button-only event nodes, so clicks from split/composite devices can be missed. It also timestamps events when they are processed and replays X/Y as separate pointer packets; I’m changing capture to include pointer-button nodes and preserve kernel `SYN_REPORT` frames so paired movement and click ordering replay accurately.
