[0m
Fixed mouse session recording and replay accuracy.

- Captures clicks from button-only/split mouse device nodes.
- Uses kernel event timestamps instead of processing time.
- Combines X/Y movement from the same input frame into one replay action.
- Preserves click and movement ordering across multiple device nodes.
- Handles dropped synchronization frames safely.
- Added regression coverage for click capture and combined-axis movement.

Verification passed:

- `cargo fmt --check`
- `cargo test --all-targets --all-features` with 26 tests
- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings`
- `git diff --check`

Physical mouse replay still needs a hardware smoke test because input devices are unavailable in this environment.
